    "number": 126,
    "summary": "1–3, Brigham Young is commended for his labors and is relieved of future travel abroad.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [
      {
        "type": "introduction",
        "text": "Revelation given through Joseph Smith the Prophet, in the house of Brigham Young, at Nauvoo, Illinois, July 9, 1841. Brigham Young had just returned to his family in Nauvoo from a nearly two-year mission to England."
      }
    ],
    "verses": [
      {
